1. `packages/mui-base/src/AutocompleteUnstyled/useAutocomplete.js`

   Function: `useAutocomplete`, specifically its internal `handleValue(event, newValue, reason, details)` function.

   Previously, `handleValue` skipped an update only when `value` and `newValue` were the same reference:

   ```js
   if (value === newValue) {
     return;
   }
   ```

   The change adds array-content comparison:

   ```js
